  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Halve the sweet potatoes and place on the lined oven tray, cut-side down. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Bake until golden and tender, 40-45 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a6719401ec5cfb774be466-4f997f2c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Finely chop brown onion. Roughly chop tomato. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and the 1/2 the garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a6719401ec5cfb774be466-64dd0968.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 5 mins remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook black beans, carrot and onion until tender, 4-6 mins.\n• Add tomato paste, spicy taco seasoning and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. (Spice blend is hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat. )\n• Stir in the water, vegetable stock powder, brown sugar and butter and cook until thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a6719401ec5cfb774be466-b76bc4d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide sweet potatoes between plates. Top with bean mixture and garlic yoghurt.\n• Serve with tomato salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64a6719401ec5cfb774be466-41f678ac.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
